  "releaseNotes": "[#150] A lone scalar Metric/Breakdown property (not a List<T>/array) now renders as its bar shape, the same as the collection forms. Previously a single Breakdown/Metric fell through to the generic complex-object renderer, producing a Field/Value + Slices table plus MARKOUT001 and CS8073 warnings instead of the bar the shape implies. Non-nullable and nullable (Metric?/Breakdown?) forms are supported; unset/default shapes render nothing.",
